## 5. Routing

Authoritative routing detail: [wrs-portal-member-routing-addendum.mdoc](../standards/wrs-portal-member-routing-addendum.mdoc).

### 5.1 Routing invariants

| Invariant | Repo evidence |
| --------- | ------------- |
| Member namespace `/me/*` only | `apps/portal/middleware.ts` |
| Registration `/catalog/{tourId}/register` outside `/me` | `app/catalog/.../register/page.tsx` |
| No portal `/tours` | WRS-PATH-02 |
| Cross-host URLs via GSH | `packages/guest-surface-host/` |
| Operator `/tours` ≠ marketing `/tours` | WRS-PATH-03 (host-separated) |

### 5.2 URL freeze table (immutable)

| URL | Surface | Notes |
| --- | ------- | ----- |
| `/me/registrations` | Portal | **Permanent alias** — module id `trips` (DL-03) |
| `/me/registrations/{id}` | Portal | Deep route |
| `/me/profile` | Portal | User menu + module |
| `/catalog/{tourId}/register` | Portal | Never under `/me/*` |
| `/` | Portal | Redirect hub — not bookmark target |
| `/tours`, `/tours/{id}` | Marketing | WRS-PATH-01 |
| `/me` | Portal | Redirect to `defaultPrimaryModuleId` (DL-40) — not content |

**Breaking change rule:** Default member entry may change only with `/me/registrations` alias retained (DL-22, DL-38).

### 5.3 Dynamic route coexistence (DL-28)

| Phase | Strategy |
| ----- | -------- |
| 1–4 | Static `app/me/registrations`, `app/me/profile`, future `app/me/home` |
| 5+ | `app/me/[[...modulePath]]/page.tsx` dispatcher; static routes win |
| Never | Dispatcher on `/catalog/*` or `/api/me/*` |

### 5.4 Cross-surface navigation

Authoritative builder registry: [routing-builders-authority.mdoc](./member-portal-shell/routing-builders-authority.mdoc).  
GSH migration: [builder-migration-contract.mdoc](./member-portal-shell/builder-migration-contract.mdoc).

| Transition | Builder | Authority |
| ---------- | ------- | --------- |
| Marketing → Portal register | `resolvePortalRegistrationUrl` | GSH |
| Marketing → Portal member | `resolvePortalMemberModuleUrl` (PS-3+; sole GSH member egress since PS-7) | GSH |
| Portal guest `/` → Marketing | `resolveMarketingPublicBaseUrl` | GSH |
| Portal register back → Marketing tour | `resolveMarketingTourDetailUrl` | GSH |
| Web `/catalog/*` → Marketing | `resolveMarketingToursUrl` / web catalog redirect helper | Web shim (Tier C) |
| Web `/catalog/*/register` → Portal | `resolvePortalRegistrationRedirectUrl` | **Web shim** — `apps/web`, not GSH |

**Admission rule (DL-37):** `guestCrossSurfaceNav` manifest entries must not link to routes that 404 on target host (e.g. `/about` on club tenants today).

### 5.5 Register path families (DL-42)

| Family | Path | Surface | Purpose |
| ------ | ---- | ------- | ------- |
| Public member registration | `/catalog/{id}/register` | Portal | OTP + intake (canonical) |
| Web egress shim | `/catalog/{id}/register` | Web | Redirect to portal only |
| Operator registration | `/tours/{id}/register` | Web | Operator session — **not** public registration |

These must **never merge**.

---

## 6. Member shell

### 6.1 Navigation tiers

| Tier | Max | Renderer |
| ---- | --- | -------- |
| Primary | 5 | Bottom nav |
| Secondary | N | More hub (by family) |
| Hidden | N | Deep link only |
| Cross-surface | N | Header egress → marketing |

### 6.2 Denali reference IA (DL-02)

**Bottom nav:** Home · Trips · Wallet · Membership · More  
**User menu:** Profile (+ logout)

Module id `trips` → route `/me/registrations` (alias).

### 6.3 Shell modes (DL-01)

| Mode | Routes |
| ---- | ------ |
| Minimal | `/catalog/{id}/register` — no bottom nav |
| Full | `/me/*` authenticated |
| Redirect | Unauthenticated `/me/*` → `/` → marketing |

---

## 7. Migration phases

Canonical naming: [phase-mapping.mdoc](./member-portal-shell/phase-mapping.mdoc) (Portal Shell PS-N ↔ Blueprint BP-N).

| BP | PS | Deliverable | Exit proof |
| -- | -- | ----------- | ---------- |
| **0** | **0** | RFC + sign-off | DL-01..42 signed |
| **1** | **1** | Portal shell frame | SMK-PTL hooks; bare `/me` redirect |
| **2** | **2** | Member registry codegen | Zero inline nav; Denali manifest |
| **3** | **3+4** | GSH builder + cross-surface nav | Builder contract; WRS addendum; manifest nav |
| **4** | **5** | Member home (platform `home`) | `/me/home`; `/` → `defaultPrimaryModuleId` |
| **5** | **5** | Entitlements + dispatcher | `/api/me/entitlements`; 10+ modules |
| **6** | **6** | Embedded host (Telegram) | GSH adapter |
| **7** | **6** | Enterprise scale (50+) | Hub virtualisation |
| **8** | **7** | **Cleanup** | [cleanup-roadmap.mdoc](./member-portal-shell/cleanup-roadmap.mdoc) |

Detailed gates: [member-portal-shell/implementation-gates.mdoc](./member-portal-shell/implementation-gates.mdoc).

---

## 8. Rollout strategy

1. **Doc-first:** Merge this RFC + WRS addendum + decision log sign-off before any `apps/portal` shell code.
2. **Alias-safe:** Ship shell + registry without changing `/me/registrations` URLs; SMK-PTL-02..08 must stay green.
3. **Phased static → dispatcher:** No catch-all until Phase 5 (DL-28).
4. **Denali first:** Reference workspace binds IA in manifest (`availability: full`); trunk workspaces use `minimal` (urban, guest-club) — not exempt (DL-18 superseded).
5. **Rollback per phase:** [implementation-gates.mdoc](./member-portal-shell/implementation-gates.mdoc) § Rollback.

---

## 9. Risks

Full register: Blueprint §13 (142 mitigated + 4 accepted in Blueprint). Summary categories:

| Category | Examples |
| -------- | -------- |
| Architectural AR-* | Hardcoded nav, registry without validation |
| Routing RT-* | GSH hardcode, `/me` 404, WRS lag, portal noindex |
| Session SR-* | PCMS, tenant bind, stale entitlements |
| BFF BF-* | Operator finance exposure, allowlist drift |
| Migration MR-* | SMK-PTL regressions |

**Residual accepted (PENDING SIGN-OFF):**

| ID | Risk | Accepted until |
| -- | ---- | -------------- |
| RA-01 | Cross-host transition latency | Phase 7 |
| RA-02 | No marketing logged-in indicator | Permanent (PCMS) |
| RA-03 | JWT role not restricted on portal | Phase 5 security review |
| RA-04 | force-dynamic root performance | Phase 7 |

